- 30–90 days: Implement pricing/package changes for new deals; cut low-ROI marketing; start automation pilot in ops or support.
- 90–180 days: Re-org for efficiency; product changes to reduce cost-to-serve; push enterprise deals with higher ACV.
- 180–365 days: Scale high-margin channels; evaluate fundraising only if runway <12 months after cost actions or to accelerate high-return growth investments.

