Goal: 14 months runway → required net burn = 2.1M / 14 ≈ $150k/month. Need to reduce net burn by ≈ $90k/month.

Path to close $90k/month gap (example mix)
- Improve gross margin by 5 p.p. → +$40k/month (from 800k revenue).
- Cut OpEx by 45k/month (≈4.3% of 1.04M) through hiring freeze + discretionary cuts.
