Scalability levers (to improve unit economics as you grow)
- Standardize product variants to reduce complexity and unit cost.
- Move fixed costs to variable (co-packers, contract manufacturers).
- Improve yield and reduce rework/returns to cut effective COGS.
- Sales efficiency: lower CAC via channel partners and product-led expansion; grow LTV via subscriptions / service attachments.
- Automation in back office (order-to-cash, procurement) to reduce FTEs per $ revenue.

