2. Current state: revenue run-rate, cash, burn, margin snapshot, customer concentration
3. Problem statement: runway risk and margin pressure
4. Action plan (90-day priorities) with estimated $ impact and time-to-impact
5. Medium-term initiatives (3–12 mo) that change unit economics
6. Scenarios: base / downside / upside with runway and EBITDA outcomes
7. Ask & governance: approvals needed (price increase, hiring freeze, supplier renegotiation), weekly cadence and KPIs

Immediate next steps I can take for you
